  ],
  "abstract": "We prove an upper bound for characters of the symmetric groups. Namely, we show that there exists a constant a > 0 with a property that for every Young diagram \u03bb with n boxes, r(\u03bb) rows and c(\u03bb) columns Tr \u03c1\u03bb(\u03c0) Tr \u03c1\u03bb(e) \u2264 \u0014 a max \u0012r(\u03bb) n , c(\u03bb) n , |\u03c0| n \u0013\u0015|\u03c0| , where |\u03c0| is the minimal number of factors needed to write \u03c0 \u2208Sn as a product of transpositions. We also give uniform estimates for the error term in the Vershik-Kerov\u2019s and Biane\u2019s character formulas and give a new formula for free cumulants of the transition measure.",
